Source file headers
-------------------
Application source files carry a short copyright header. Templates and rules
for agents (any tool): docs/steering/file-header.md and docs/steering/handover.md.

UI brand footer
---------------
Canonical component: resources/js/Components/brand/BrandCopyright.vue
Backend constants: app/Support/BrandAttribution.php
Do not remove product/owner attribution from sidebar or landing without owner authorization.
Encrypting Vue footers or hiding folders with DB keys is not supported (ineffective DRM).
Legal protection is the MIT LICENSE + NOTICE retention, plus project process for agents.

Owner (jejakawan) logo / favicon
--------------------------------
Runtime assets: public/brand/jejakawan/{logo.png,favicon.ico,apple-touch-icon.png}
Default browser favicon: public/favicon.ico (copy of jejakawan)
School/custom override (optional): public/brand/custom/favicon.ico (+ logo.png)
If custom is absent, app.blade.php falls back to jejakawan assets.
Source drop folder (not served): docs/logo/
